WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.471 --> 00:00:03.242
I want to take a quick drive
around the city of Berlin,

00:00:03.242 --> 00:00:04.608
I wanted to do it in an authentic way,

00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:07.017
this is Tina, you've agreed to help me

00:00:07.017 --> 00:00:08.890
and you brought me this car.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:09.723
What is it?

00:00:09.723 --> 00:00:10.560
[Tina] That's a Trabant.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.229
The only car that you
could have in east Germany

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:13.288
was a Trabant.

00:00:13.288 --> 00:00:14.121
Yeah.

00:00:14.121 --> 00:00:14.954
[Conan] Is it a hard car to drive?

00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:16.460
Yeah, I will show you.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.293
(laughter)

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:18.126
[Tina] See.

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:18.959
[Conan] What's the problem?

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:19.792
Maybe we could...

00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:22.072
Look the whole car, look
at that, look at that,

00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:22.905
it's like a toy,

00:00:22.905 --> 00:00:24.026
Ok. 

00:00:24.026 --> 00:00:24.967
(audience laughing)

00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:27.710
There you go, I'm a
gentleman, are you okay Tina?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.543
[Tina] It works.

00:00:28.543 --> 00:00:29.376
Very good.

00:00:29.376 --> 00:00:32.456
Look at these buttons, I mean
yes, okay, windshield wiper,

00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:34.123
oh, that's adorable,

00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:37.835
schloopy, schleipy, schloopy, schleipy

00:00:37.835 --> 00:00:39.096
Don't say it like that.

00:00:39.096 --> 00:00:40.723
Why?

00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:41.782
It's something nasty,

00:00:41.782 --> 00:00:42.882
(speaking in German)

00:00:42.882 --> 00:00:44.756
What did I say, be
honest, what did I say?

00:00:44.756 --> 00:00:46.138
Vagina something...

00:00:46.138 --> 00:00:47.441
(audience chuckling)

00:00:47.441 --> 00:00:49.314
The second word didn't
make any sense but you said

00:00:49.314 --> 00:00:51.023
"vagina something"

00:00:51.023 --> 00:00:52.367
That's what I meant to say.

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:53.305
Okay.

00:00:53.305 --> 00:00:54.138
(audience laughing)

00:00:54.138 --> 00:00:55.710
You want to get it in first
gear, you have to pull it down

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.543
[Conan] Right.

00:00:56.543 --> 00:00:57.376
[Tina] Yes.

00:00:57.376 --> 00:00:58.209
[Conan] Then what?

00:00:58.209 --> 00:00:59.042
Up.

00:00:59.042 --> 00:00:59.875
Up.

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:00.708
Okay, then where would third be?

00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:01.778
Go to neutral and then pull it. 

00:01:01.778 --> 00:01:04.546
So you gotta get it
back to neutral, pull,

00:01:04.546 --> 00:01:05.379
and then press down.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:07.204
Exactly, yes, exactly.

00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:08.709
What happens when you want to do reverse?

00:01:08.709 --> 00:01:10.503
I think I would probably
just get out of the car

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.336
(audience laughing)

00:01:11.336 --> 00:01:12.381
and push it back this way.

00:01:12.381 --> 00:01:14.831
(car engine starts)

00:01:14.831 --> 00:01:16.619
(loud muffler sounds)

00:01:16.619 --> 00:01:17.473
Woo.

00:01:17.473 --> 00:01:18.410
Okay, what happened there?

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:19.344
You need to give gas.

00:01:19.344 --> 00:01:20.177
I did give gas.

00:01:20.177 --> 00:01:21.010
Yeah, more.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.558
This is a performance anxiety for me.

00:01:22.558 --> 00:01:23.451
(laughter)

00:01:23.451 --> 00:01:24.387
Do you know what that is?

00:01:24.387 --> 00:01:25.220
Yes.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.668
When a man is with a
beautiful woman and he becomes

00:01:26.668 --> 00:01:28.133
a little nervous.

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:29.640
Yeah, with the shift?

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.105
With the shift, yes

00:01:31.105 --> 00:01:32.085
(laughter)

00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:33.335
Yes, very good.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:35.927
(engine starts)

00:01:35.927 --> 00:01:37.350
Then up, I just showed you the gears,

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:38.900
first I'll show you the gears

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.571
(engine revs)

00:01:40.571 --> 00:01:42.447
(music)

00:01:42.447 --> 00:01:43.752
[Conan] So far so good.

00:01:43.752 --> 00:01:46.325
[Tina] So far, so good but
your only drive in first gear.

00:01:46.325 --> 00:01:47.158
[Conan] Yeah.

00:01:47.158 --> 00:01:48.806
[Tina] Yeah, that's easy.

00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:50.804
Oh my god, what you doing?

00:01:50.804 --> 00:01:51.887
Drive straight.

00:01:52.796 --> 00:01:54.788
(Conan laughing)

00:01:54.788 --> 00:01:57.718
(Conan speaking in German)

00:01:57.718 --> 00:01:59.180
The problem is it's not a very good car

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.504
for romance cause if I
was on a date with you,

00:02:01.504 --> 00:02:06.025
and it was going well and I
wanted to put my arm around you

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:06.858
look, I can't...

00:02:06.858 --> 00:02:07.691
That's true.

00:02:07.691 --> 00:02:08.524
That's very hard

00:02:08.524 --> 00:02:09.357
Yeah.

00:02:09.357 --> 00:02:10.190
In this car

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:11.023
Yes.

00:02:11.023 --> 00:02:11.856
To get my arm around you.

00:02:11.856 --> 00:02:13.478
Yes, maybe we should
concentrate on the car again?

00:02:13.478 --> 00:02:15.840
(audience laughing)

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.407
Just shot down in the
shittiest car I've ever been in.

00:02:18.407 --> 00:02:19.547
(audience laughing loudly)

00:02:19.547 --> 00:02:20.483
It's a new low.

00:02:20.483 --> 00:02:22.882
Do you think maybe a second date?

00:02:22.882 --> 00:02:24.674
Maybe we just leave it like that?

00:02:24.674 --> 00:02:27.931
(audience laughs)

00:02:27.931 --> 00:02:28.948
All right, nice to see you.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:29.781
Nice to see you.

00:02:29.781 --> 00:02:30.659
Take care.

00:02:30.659 --> 00:02:31.492
Bye.

00:02:32.575 --> 00:02:35.158
(German music)

